# The store's modules, copied in by bundle.py. A build product: bundle.ensure
# rebuilds it at import in a checkout and firebase.json's predeploy rebuilds it
# before a deploy, so a tracked copy could only ever be a stale second version.
cs_store/
# The virtualenv the functions emulator and the deploy build here.
venv/
# Resolved emulator ports, written by emulators.py when it walks past a port
# something else holds. Per-machine and per-run, so never tracked.
.firebase.emulators.json
.firebase.emulators.env
